#: ink/pentest.lua
msgid ""
"Faster drawing on this reader\n"
"\n"
"KOReader can't choose the fast e-ink refresh on this device, so its own refresh mode for KOReader decides how quickly ink appears.\n"
"\n"
"Look for a per-app refresh or speed mode for KOReader in the device's settings, and choose the fastest.\n"
"\n"
